                  "id": "tnE0k",
                  "name": "Motion Note",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Everything eases out, nothing bounces hard — calm confidence, not hype. The character is the only thing that moves; the interface stays still. After a rejection the same character appears, but the motion drops to a single slow blink and the copy softens. Ads reuse beat 3 as the last 400ms so the feed loop ends on the cheer.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
